  npcName: Dovey
  dialogue:
  - Hiya! I'm Dovey!
  - What's that? Are you learning to sign? That's wonderful!
  - You look like you could use some greetings!
  - There are many signs that give easier ways of saying something instead of having
    to spell out every single letter! We can start with greetings!
  - "When you\u2019re ready, let\u2019s begin!"
  - DEMONSTRATION
  - Now you try it!
  - SIGNING
  - SIGNING
  - Amazing!
  - "Splendid! Now let\u2019s learn how to say our farewells!"
  - DEMONSTRATION
  - Now let's see if you got that!
  - SIGNING
  - SIGNING
  - SIGNING
  - Wow you've got the hang of this!
  - Nice job buddy! I can see that you'll be SOARING through ASL in no time!
  - Bye for now!
  lessonSigns:
  - Hello!
  - My name is
  - Goodbye!
  - Nice to meet you!
  - See you later!
